sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Status event publisher (M9)
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant C as Webhook consumer
    participant DB as Webhook database
    participant W as Delivery worker
    participant M as Merchant receiver
    participant UI as Merchant delivery log
    P->>Q: parcel.status.changed (stable eventId, merchantId)
    Q->>C: Deliver event
    C->>DB: Insert unique subscription/event delivery
    C-->>Q: Acknowledge after durable insert
    W->>DB: Claim due delivery with expiring lease
    W->>M: POST exact payload + HMAC signature
    alt 2xx response
        W->>DB: SUCCESS + attempt history
    else Failure
        W->>DB: RETRYING with exponential delay
        Note over W,DB: Three total attempts per run
        W->>DB: DEAD_LETTER + durable outbox
        C->>Q: Publish dead-letter notification with confirmation
    end
    UI->>DB: Read owned delivery through API
    UI->>C: Replay dead-letter delivery
    C->>DB: Requeue original event; preserve history
    W->>M: Retry original eventId after receiver recovers
